{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-better-workspaces#card-zh","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-better-workspaces","commit":"189757381a5cf0120fd20826a462d24ad6cac79f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Better Workspaces 是 DSH Web 插件，为每项开发任务创建独立 Git worktree，并把工作区操作整合到网页会话界面。它在输入框附近提供本地与新 worktree 模式，可从本地或远程分支创建工作区，并在侧栏显示分支和改动概况。用户还能查看文件差异、提交历史，执行提交、拉取、推送及 PR 操作，并把 GitHub Issue 或 PR 引用附加到提示词。适合需要并行处理代码任务、审阅改动和关联 GitHub 事项的 DSH Web 用户；需要本机 Git，GitHub CLI 可选。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:155-200","lib/client.js:2465-2530","lib/client.js:2680-2710","lib/actions.js:1-4"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-better-workspaces#card-en","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-better-workspaces","commit":"189757381a5cf0120fd20826a462d24ad6cac79f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Better Workspaces brings Git worktrees to DSH Web. Create isolated workspaces from branches, track branch and change summaries, review diffs and commit history, and perform Git and pull request actions. Attach GitHub issue or PR context to prompts. Git is required; GitHub CLI is optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:155-200","lib/client.js:2465-2530","lib/client.js:2680-2710","lib/actions.js:1-4"]}
