{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-better-workspaces#feature-1","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-better-workspaces","commit":"189757381a5cf0120fd20826a462d24ad6cac79f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Better Workspaces 的功能「隔离 Git 工作区」：为任务从本地或远程分支创建独立 worktree 和关联会话。在输入框附近切换到新 worktree 模式后填写分支并创建，工作区用于隔离该任务的文件修改。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2465-2530","lib/client.js:2824-2835"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-better-workspaces#feature-2","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-better-workspaces","commit":"189757381a5cf0120fd20826a462d24ad6cac79f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Better Workspaces 的功能「差异与历史审阅」：在网页差异面板查看工作区文件改动和提交历史，并切换不同的比较范围。用户从侧栏的差异入口打开视图，选择文件和差异范围进行审阅。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1938-1945","lib/actions.js:1-4"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-better-workspaces#feature-3","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-better-workspaces","commit":"189757381a5cf0120fd20826a462d24ad6cac79f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Better Workspaces 的功能「网页 Git 操作」：从差异界面发起提交、拉取、推送、更新基线或 PR 相关操作。用户在工作区的差异视图选择操作，插件调用主机端 Git 与 GitHub 集成流程并呈现结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/actions.js:1-4","lib/index.js:218-240"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-better-workspaces#feature-4","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-better-workspaces","commit":"189757381a5cf0120fd20826a462d24ad6cac79f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Better Workspaces 的功能「GitHub 事项引用」：浏览仓库开放 Issue 和 PR，并把选中事项附加到提示词。用户从输入框旁选择条目，发送时展开其标题、正文、分支信息和链接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2680-2690","lib/client.js:4116-4128"]}
